<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>白绮 · 为我前驱</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_TITLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Baiqi · Go Forth for Me</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_GLOBAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开关内政托管</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_GLOBAL" Language="en_US"><Text>Toggle administration</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_CITY" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>接管／交回所选城市</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_CITY" Language="en_US"><Text>Take over / return selected city</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_UNIT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>接管／交回所选文职</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_UNIT" Language="en_US"><Text>Take over / return selected civilian</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_PROTECT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>保留／解放所选对象地块</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_UI_PROTECT" Language="en_US"><Text>Protect / release selected plot</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_BAIQI_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>白绮</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_BAIQI_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Baiqi</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BAIQI_FORERUNNER_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>为我前驱</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BAIQI_FORERUNNER_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Go Forth for Me</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BAIQI_FORERUNNER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>自动安排生产、区域建设、建造者改良与移民扩张，均支付正常成本。军队行动由你指挥，可随时暂停城市或文职托管。[NEWLINE]与敌城相邻的近战、抗骑兵或骑兵陆军，可在击破城防后征取粮仓经营权；城市生命降至35%时还可征取整城。支付金币并结束该单位本回合行动，由你确认发动。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BAIQI_FORERUNNER_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Automatically plans production, districts, builder improvements and peaceful settlement at normal costs. You command the army and may take over any city or civilian.[NEWLINE]Adjacent melee, anti-cavalry or cavalry armies may requisition a Granary's operating rights after breaking the outer defenses, or the whole city at 35% health. Requires gold, ends the unit's movement and only activates on your confirmation.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_BAIQI" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>白绮，令城市为你运转，率军亲临战场。为我前驱。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_BAIQI" Language="en_US"><Text>Baiqi, let your cities work while you lead the army. Go forth for me.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_QUOTE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>为我前驱。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_BAIQI_QUOTE" Language="en_US"><Text>Go forth for me.</Text></Row>
  </LocalizedText>
</GameData>
